{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 DEATH GAME HOTEL \u2013 High-Stakes VR Poker Like Never Before!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Game Hotel is an intense VR poker battle, blending high-risk gambling with survival. Face off in Death Poker, where you bet more than chips\u2014you risk your body parts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/8d3213aed76048c06b2b0d20e4fb1b67.poster.avif?t=1772794171\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/8d3213aed76048c06b2b0d20e4fb1b67.webm?t=1772794171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/8d3213aed76048c06b2b0d20e4fb1b67.mp4?t=1772794171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf Death Poker \u2013 Raise the Stakes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A twisted take on Texas Hold\u2019em with a deadly new \u2018Death\u2019 suit:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strongest Hand \u2192 Hands with a Death card Weakest Hand \u2192 Can\u2019t use Death? You lose. Go All In \u2192 Bet chips\u2026 or your hands, eyes, or ears Can you handle the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras/247e39496b5d21fb801a0ba4ce53c300.avif?t=1772794171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636230/extras_big/247e39496b5d21fb801a0ba4ce53c300.avif?t=1772794171 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><stron